A||||6||TRiAD||Swapping Getrag into 4sp car?||||1||
Z||000000||TRiAD||10-19-2001||11:26 PM||||Sorry if this has been asked 1000 times, but...<P>Is there a way to swap the Getrag 5sp manual into a 4sp manual GT? Are there detailed instructions on this anywhere?<P>Thanks so much!<P>------------------<BR><B><I>Michael ~ triadtuning@hotmail.com</I></B><BR>-----------------<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/88FieroGTwhitefscustomcroppedmini.jpg"> <BR><I>Photoshop rendering of planned exterior modifications.</I>||||reg||1
Z||000001||FieroJoe||10-19-2001||11:48 PM||||You will need a new shift cables, complete console shift brackets, new cable brackets (should come with tranny), new clutch, get your flywheel machined, new slave and master cylinder, and probably some other stuff I am forgetting.  The best way to do a swap like this is either pull everything that you can imagine you'd need from the parts car or try to buy the whole parts car so you can have it there to mess with.<P>Also, you will need to re wire your backup lights to now be controlled by the switch that will be in the tranny and not attached to the shifter.||||reg||1
Z||000002||Rodney||10-20-2001||08:37 AM|||| <A HREF="http://www.rodneydickman.com/transaxle.html" TARGET=_blank>http://www.rodneydickman.com/transaxle.html</A> <P>   <A HREF="http://www.rodneydickman.com/getraginfo.htm" TARGET=_blank>http://www.rodneydickman.com/getraginfo.htm</A> <BR>   (Getrag conversion articale)<P>   <A HREF="http://www.rodneydickman.com/n36.html" TARGET=_blank>http://www.rodneydickman.com/n36.html</A> <BR>   (split the case info)<P>||||reg||1
Z||000003||TRiAD||10-20-2001||11:49 AM||||Thanks guys!<P>Rodney, do you offer this service, and how much is it if you do?<P>Thanks!||||reg||1
Z||000004||terryk||11-04-2001||07:31 PM||||Why do you need a new master cylinder for the clutch?||||reg||1
Z||000005||88formula||11-04-2001||07:37 PM||||Your car will run worse 1/4 mile times with a 5-speed Getrag compared to a Muncie 4-speed. <P>------------------<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/88formula_logo_1.JPG">  <p>[This message has been edited by 88formula (edited 11-04-2001).]||||reg||1
Z||000006||BOILERMAKER||11-04-2001||09:19 PM||||You don't "need" the new master and slave cylinders.  Sure they would be nice, but you don't "need" them.||||reg||1
